Davemon wrote:

> Is using wiz-mode like using god-mode in Quake?

Yes, sort of.

> I mean, is it actually 'cheating', and should you try to ascend at least 
> once without having used Wizmode?

Wizmode is for debugging/testing.  There's no point in playing a full game
in wizmode.  A "wizmode ascension" is not a real ascension (and won't be
added to the score file). 

Playing in wizmode won't make real games any easier; in fact, the opposite
is probably true, since you're less likely to learn from mistakes.

There is also an "explore" mode which would be better to use than wizmode
if you just want to look around the dungeon without dying.

